<title>USA: M H Meyerson stake sold by Duke &amp; Co.</title>
<headline>M H Meyerson stake sold by Duke &amp; Co.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duke &amp; Co Inc, a New York City-based broker/dealer, said Wednesday it sold its stake in M H Meyerson &amp; Co Inc, a New Jersey-based securities firm.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Duke said it sold its 275,000 common shares of the company between Jan 29 and 31 at $3.0625 to $3.50 per share.</p>
<p>Duke said it originally held the stake as an investment.</p>
</text>
